Description:It is your second main phase. You control Witherbloom Apprentice (magecraft - whenever you cast or copy an instant or sorcery spell, each opponent loses 1 life and you gain 1) and have Opt and Twincast in hand with three blue mana floating. The opponent is at 3 life and controls a tapped Silent Arbiter. Reduce the opponent to 0 life this turn.
Rule:authored-magecraft-copy | Copying a spell is not casting it (CR 707.10), but magecraft triggers on both (CR 207.2c): cast Opt (1), Twincast it (1 for casting Twincast, 1 for the copy) for 3; Opt alone drains 1
